HELEN ▸ Run LOCAL-FIRST autoresearch.
MODE:
authority=false
claim=NO_CLAIM
ledger_effect=none
RULE:
Use local LLMs for generation, compression, packet drafting, and schema checks.
Use FABLE only as final min-gate on the best survivor.
ROLES:
Gemma4 = lateral proposer
Qwen = CHIDDUSH compressor
HELEN local = WULmath/schema validator
FABLE = PASS / SOFT_FAIL / HARD_BLOCK only
JM = decision
LOOP:
1. Gemma generates raw ideas.
2. Qwen extracts invariants.
3. HELEN local emits CHIDDUSH_RECEIPT_V0 candidates.
4. Local validator rejects malformed packets.
5. Select only top survivor.
6. Send only that survivor to FABLE_MIN_GATE.
7. FABLE returns PASS / SOFT_FAIL / HARD_BLOCK.
8. No admission without JM.
FORBIDDEN:
raw idea → FABLE
FABLE writes packets
FABLE creates tasks
local model claims truth
autoresearch admits state
FINAL:
local candidates
local rejects
one FABLE-gated survivor
JM decision menu
authority=false